<li><a href="https://github.com/postgres/postgres/blob/REL_18_STABLE/src/backend/commands/explain.c">PostgreSQL 18 EXPLAIN implementation</a>: totals for heap fetches and per-loop division of rejection counters.</li>
<li><a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/using-explain.html">Using EXPLAIN</a> and <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-explain.html">EXPLAIN</a>: row and loop units, inclusive counters, searches, timing, buffers and output conversion.</li>
